  "description": "Fixed-rhythm page bounce and a flying whale-girl plush with wall reflections for the DSH web interface.",
  "descriptionZh": "让 DSH 网页界面与大肥鱼娘玩偶按固定节奏 Q 弹，玩偶满屏飞行、碰墙反弹。",
